                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.13/25.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 18, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President has vetoed the amnesty bill.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
